        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-17" value="path: project/crews/poem_crew.py" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" y="1340" width="520" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-18" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; class PoemCrew:&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &quot;&quot;&quot;Poem Crew&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;agents_config&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;tasks_config&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="1410" width="530" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-19" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.654;entryY=0.933;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-9" target="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-17" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-20" value="Difference between Agents and Workflows? #&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Agentic System:&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agent:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Autonomous sytem&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, just tell the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;goal &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;to sytem will do on your behalf, may have multiple steps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Workflows:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;semi autonoumos ,If you are creating LLM based application, have pre-defined steps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;If steps are fixed then called workflows, If decision taken by LLM called Agent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="15" y="1635" width="820" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Agentic AI Design Patterns&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="45" y="1540" width="760" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-22" value="Anthropic breaks down the development process into incremental pattern , from basic building block to full agent architecturs&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Augmented LLM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Augmented LLMs presented as the fundamental building blocks , enhanced the capabilities like retrieval,tool use and memory.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workflow: Prompt Chaining&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prompt Chaining decomposes a complex tasks into sequential subtasks, where each LLM call feeds into the next&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workflow: Routing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Routing involves classifying an input to direct it to the appropriate specialized follow-up process.This seperation of concerns helps handling diverse input types with customized prompts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workflow: Parallelization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parallelization leverages multiple simultaneous LLM calls either to handle independent subtasks(sectioning) or to obtain diverse outputs(voting)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workflow: Orchestrator-Workers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;In this design ,a central &quot;orchestrator&quot; LLM dynamically breaks down a complex task, delegates subtasks to &quot;worker LLMs&quot; and synthesizes the result.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workflow: Evaluator-Optimizer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Here one LLM call generates an output while another evaluates and refines it in loop. This iterative feedback process is analogous to human editing and is useful when there are clear evaluation criteria.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Autonomous Agents&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Moving beyond workflows , the guide defines autonomous agents as systems where the LLM interacts with users to understand a task ,plans its approach , and then independently executes the necessary steps -using tools and environmental feedback along the way. These agents can pause a request human feedback when needed and incorporate stopping conditions to prevent&amp;nbsp; runway processes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="18" y="1920" width="815" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-23" value="&lt;b&gt;Building Blocks: The Augmented LLM&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="18" y="2230" width="822" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3T-5ptilE91INUeZc9yN-24" value="The basic building block of agentic systems is an LLM enhanced with augmentation such as retrieval,tools and memory.our current models can actively use these capabilities -generating their own search queries selecting appropriate tools , and determining what information to retain" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="2260" width="805" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
