        <mxCell id="WJhOJ3gFspsxyZuNcKOg-2" value="In this directory , create an ecommerce web site and list some dummy products related to men and women clothing use node.js 15 and make the site responseive and good looking&lt;div&gt;Assume a role of website builder , create a website name as shairaj where we take order of foods with some indian dishes use node.js 22 and make site responsive and interactive for family&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
